{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `raw_proportion`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: moved the likelihood left-hand side from a transformed-data variable to a top-level protected data variable `raw_proportion`. In `data_safe.json`, `raw_proportion[j]` is deterministically computed from the supplied data as `y[j] / n[j]`, matching the original transformed-data definition. The original `y` and `n` inputs are retained as context data. The vectorized prior `[sigma_angle, sigma_distance, sigma_y] ~ normal(0, 1)` was split into one built-in prior sampling statement per top-level parameter and placed before the likelihood, so each parameter is observed by its prior before being used in the model block. No likelihood or posterior density change was made.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int J;
  array[J] int n;
  vector[J] x;
  array[J] int y;
  vector[J] raw_proportion;
  real r;
  real R;
  real overshot;
  real distance_tolerance;
}
transformed data {
  vector[J] threshold_angle = asin((R - r) ./ x);
}
parameters {
  real<lower=0> sigma_angle;
  real<lower=0> sigma_distance;
  real<lower=0> sigma_y;
}
transformed parameters {
  vector[J] p_angle = 2 * Phi(threshold_angle / sigma_angle) - 1;
  vector[J] p_distance = Phi((distance_tolerance - overshot)
                             ./ ((x + overshot) * sigma_distance))
                         - Phi((-overshot)
                               ./ ((x + overshot) * sigma_distance));
  vector[J] p = p_angle .* p_distance;
}
model {
  sigma_angle ~ normal(0, 1);
  sigma_distance ~ normal(0, 1);
  sigma_y ~ normal(0, 1);
  raw_proportion ~ normal(p,
                          sqrt(p .* (1 - p) ./ to_vector(n) + sigma_y ^ 2));
}
generated quantities {
  real sigma_degrees = sigma_angle * 180 / pi();
  vector[J] residual = raw_proportion - p;
}
","data_safe_json":"{"J":4,"R":4.1137793185646245,"distance_tolerance":5.6644073265927934,"n":[4,6,2,6],"overshot":3.4806028092757164,"r":5.3828825037282595,"x":[3.5674933162290268,2.572053464653129,5.936740785107766,3.375917159552671],"y":[4,2,2,4],"raw_proportion":[1.0,0.3333333333333333,1.0,0.6666666666666666]}","protected_variables":["raw_proportion"]}
